{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStem\/color"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStem"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"color","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLStemV5colorAA8MXLColorVSgvp"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstem\/color"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLStem":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstem","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStem","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLStem","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stems can be down, up, none, or double. For down and up stems, the position attributes can be used to specify"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stem length. The relative values specify the end of the stem relative to the program default. Default values"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specify an absolute end stem position. Negative values of relative-y that would flip a stem instead of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shortening it are ignored. A stem element associated with a rest refers to a stemlet."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLStem","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLStem"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","title":"IvorMXL","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLColor":{"title":"MXLColor","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The color type indicates the color of an element. Color may be represented as hexadecimal RGB triples, as in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"HTML, or as hexadecimal ARGB tuples, with the A indicating alpha of transparency. An alpha value of 00 is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"totally transparent; FF is totally opaque. If RGB is used, the A value is assumed to be FF.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcolor"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLStem/color":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStem\/color","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstem\/color","role":"symbol","title":"color","abstract":[{"text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text